WEBVTT
Kind: subtitles
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.790
The abuser exploits this trust
to blur the victim's boundaries

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:07.990
and gradually cross the limits
of a healthy relationship.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.350
To do this, the abuser may build a special bond
with the athlete, based on friendship or closeness.

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:18.830
They give the victim gifts
and invite them to their home.

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:24.269
They increase contact through
frequent phone calls and messages.

00:00:24.279 --> 00:00:28.710
They establish secrets shared
between coach and athlete.

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:37.320
The gradual normalization of harassment
and sexual abuse is a key feature of grooming.
